Z||000017||Shaun41178||04-02-2000||12:19 PM||||I think many of you are confused.  This is qtr mile trap speed not top speed.<P>The pot is so large because the import guys have a long way to go in order to reach 200 mph in the qtr.  right now the fastest ones are running around 160 mph trap speeds but that is a Posche and might not count.  So you can see it will be well into the future before they hit 200.<P>Besides I am sure some import guy has already hit 200 mph top speed in their car.  for example Stealths are allowed which means the twin turbo kind are allowed.  They already have a top speed around 150-160.  put larger turbos on it and do basic hot rod techniques and up the boost and it will hit 200 mph.  Same goes for the NSX too and mitsubishi 3000GT VR4||||reg||1
